ooting Grips Mount Adaptors Lens Accessories Cases Memory Cards & Storage Batteries & Chargers Flashes & Accessories Microphones Lens Hoods Cloud Service Creators Cloud Discover Creators Cloud Camera Remote SDK Discover Camera Remote SDK Car Audio Car Audio Discover Car Audio Mobile ES™ Series Receivers & Players Amplifiers Speakers & Subwoofers Automotive OEM Branded Audio Discover Automotive OEM Branded Audio Media, Storage & Cables Memory Cards, Storage & Cables Discover Memory Cards, Storage & Cables SD Memory Cards Cables Card Readers CFexpress Memory Cards XQD Memory Cards Professional Products & Solutions Professional Products & Solutions Discover Professional Products & Solutions PlayStation Support Support Sony and the Environment Sony Group Site Sony Corporation Sony Design Sony Professional PlayStation® Sustainability Environment Accesibility Diversity, Equity & Inclusion Social Contribution Sony Pictures Sony Music Sony Biotechnology Support Open/Close Headphones Headphones WF-1000XM5 Headphones Discover Headphones Discover Products Products Truly Wireless Headband In-Ear Off-Ear Gaming Pro Noise Cancelling Wireless Accessories Accessories Compare Compare WF-1000XM5 Wireless Noise Cancelling Headphones Selected model: WF1000XM5/PZIN Colour variation Smoky Pink MRP Rs.29,990 1 (incl. of all taxes) Buy WF-1000XM5 WF-1000XM5 Overview Features Specifications Rating and Review The advanced noise cancelling headphones WF-1000XM5 The WF-1000XM5 feature cutting-edge technology to deliver premium sound quality and the most advanced noise cancelling performance on the market. Real-time audio processors and high-performance mics power the specially designed driver unit Dynamic Driver X, for wide frequency reproduction, deep bass and clear vocals. They are designed to immerse you in a sound so good, it feels like you're in the studio with your favourite artists. The WF-1000XM5 headphones raise the bar for distraction-free listening and clarity. Customers reviews icn-reviewstar-empty 536 reviews Rated 4.1 out of 5 based on 536 reviews reviews Share Facebook Twitter Discover new colour: Smoky Pink 00:30 Share Ã— live 00:00 00:30 HD Quality Ã— Audio Audio Ã— 1x Speed Ã— 0.2x 0.5x 1x 2x 10x CC Subtitles Ã— Read the video text transcript for this video Discover WF-1000XM5 features Please accept YouTube cookies to watch this video Access your cookie preferences below and make sure to switch on the YouTube cookie under the \"Functional\" section. Manage Cookies Take a short survey about this video Sony Noise Cancelling Headphones WF-1000XM5 Product Video (with Audio Description) | Official Video Hear from Sony Sound Experts on the WF-1000XM5 Find out what the developers of the WF-1000XM5 have to say about the design and build of their product. Take a look around the WF-1000XM5 headphones The advanced noise cancelling The WF-1000XM5 reduces external noise over a wide bandwidth, from low to high frequencies. It contains two proprietary processors that cancel more external noise than ever, a new high-performance driver unit Dynamic Driver X, dual feedback microphones, and innovative Noise Isolation Earbud Tips for a more stable fit. Real-time noise-cancelling processing can be optimised to provide the best performance for your environment, so you will hear a big difference, especially in aeroplanes, trains or buses. Explore Noise Cancellation Astonishing sound quality The specially designed driver unit Dynamic Driver X provides wide frequency reproduction, enabling deeper bass, subtle vocals and enhanced fine detail, especially on high-pitched instruments. The consummate performance, across the full range of frequencies, delivers a smooth and natural sound regardless of what you're listening to. Learn more about these features The advanced call quality Thanks to an AI-based noise reduction algorithm based on Deep Neural Network (DNN) processing, and bone conduction sensors, your voice will come through clear and more natural, even in a noisy environment. And if you're outdoors, the noise-reduction structure will minimise any wind whooshes, so you always know you'll be heard. Explore call quality Small and beautifully designed With an improved glossy texture and a more luxurious feel, these earbuds fit comfortably in your ears while keeping out external sounds. By downsizing the headphone body and optimising the placement of the components, the earbud is now approximately 25% smaller and 20% lighter than the WF-1000XM4. We've also reduced the size of the charging case, so it will sit even more sleekly in your pocket. Learn more about wearability Intuitive Operation Our smart features make it easier than ever to access and enjoy your entertainment throughout the day. For example, you can control the volume without opening your phone by double-tapping the headphones, and depending on the settings, you can access your regular music service without opening the app. With simple customisation available in the free Sound Connect app you can assign your own functions to each earbud. Operating these headphones is effortless and they will fit seamlessly into your life. Explore Intuitive Operation FEATURES Noise cancelling Sound quality Call Quality Design and Wearability Connections New Listening Style Intuitive Operation Functionality Sustainability HIGHLIGHTS The best noise cancelling 2 with two high-performance processors and dual feedback microphones Stunning sound quality with specially designed driver unit Superior noise-free calls with bone conduction sensor and noise reduction system (using AI) Premium, ergonomic design for stable, comfortable fit Water resistance and long battery life for everyday use Full specifications DIMENSIONS COMPONENTS Sony is committed not only to offering products, services and content that deliver exciting experiences but also to working towards our goal of a zero environmental footprint throughout our business activities. Find out about Sony and the environment PRODUCT REVIEWS USERS SAY 4 4 based on 536 customer reviews Sound quality Excellent Design Good Ease of Use Good See all reviews SUPPORT WF-1000XM5 Support Downloads Manuals Question & Answers Footnotes 1 Quoted MRP is for 1 unit of the product. Prices are subject to change without prior notice. 2 As of 1 September 2024. Ambient noise reduction according to research by Sony Corporation, measured using JEITA-compliant guidelines for the top 10 brands (by market share) of truly wireless style of noise-cancelling headphones market. 3 This product is also known as WF-1000XM5.SIN,WF-1000XM5.BIN,WF1000XM5/PZIN * Actual product may differ slightly in appearance to illustrations/ picture provided. * Features, Specification, weight & price are subject to change without prior notice. * While efforts have been placed to provide accurate information, there could be human errors which may crept in. In the event of discrepancy, the product operating instructions supplied with product shall be the authentic reference point. * Services availability depends on region. A part or whole of software/services installed into or accessible through the product may be changed, discontinued, removed, suspended, or terminated without notice. * The Bluetooth® word mark and logos are registered trademarks owned by Bluetooth SIG, Inc. and any use of such marks by Sony Group Corporation and its subsidiaries is under licence. * Network services, content, and the [operating system and] software of this Product may be subject to individual terms and conditions and changed, interrupted or discontinued at any time and may require fees, registration and credit card information. Find a Store Find a Store Search See Our Locations Support Support Online Help Track Repair Status Locate Service Centres In the news In the news Press Center Contact Us Contact Us Newsletter Subscriptions Contact Us India Company Info E-Waste Management Corporate Social Responsibilities Careers Professional Products & Solutions Site Map L